[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 841.99, "timestamp": "00:14:01", "text": "呃，不是电脑的问题，特别是配置方面，这台电脑的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 846.629, "timestamp": "00:14:06", "text": "配置相当高效。 啊，所以，嗯，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 852.629, "timestamp": "00:14:12", "text": "浏览器那样，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 855.189, "timestamp": "00:14:15", "text": "会工作的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 857.67, "timestamp": "00:14:17", "text": "我觉得这个雪花动画"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 862.629, "timestamp": "00:14:22", "text": "让我的电脑直接关机了。 哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 869.509, "timestamp": "00:14:29", "text": "长者相比，他们的天空是否也同样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 872.55, "timestamp": "00:14:32", "text": "高不可攀？ 哦好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 875.91, "timestamp": "00:14:35", "text": "好的。 好的。 所以，是的，在我家，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 880.15, "timestamp": "00:14:40", "text": "我的房产价值以前大概是 1 万到 2 万美元，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 883.75, "timestamp": "00:14:43", "text": "因为我们当时还在一个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 886.949, "timestamp": "00:14:46", "text": "呃……是什么来着，一个单元的……就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 890.15, "timestamp": "00:14:50", "text": "电力城那个……对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 894.47, "timestamp": "00:14:54", "text": "所以，在第一次装修之后，我们把它租了出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 897.59, "timestamp": "00:14:57", "text": "现在，"}]